; The bar table under a [3 4] → [4 4] change (plan 03, phase 2), and what
; a snap does across it.
;
; At 500 000 microseconds to the quarter: a [3 4] bar is three quarters
; (138 378 240 ticks) and a [4 4] bar is four (184 504 320). Bars 0 and 1
; are the short ones, so bar 2 starts at 276 756 480 and every bar after
; it is four quarters long.
;
; The meter change is ON a bar line, which is the only place plan 03
; allows one (`meter_off_bar` otherwise).
(timeline :title "meter-change" :length 5bar)

(tempo-point :at 0q :us 500000)
(meter-point :at 0bar :sig [3 4])
(meter-point :at 2bar :sig [4 4])
